OL,3,GNEWSAHow three schools are becoming one
OL,4,A- but still across three sites
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpening any new school comes with
OL,7,Fchallenges, but opening one across
OL,8,Fthree sites in different locations
OL,9,Fbrings a unique set of logistical and
OL,10,Fpractical demands.
OL,12,FFor Causeway Academy principal Ruth
OL,13,FHarkness, the priority is making the
OL,14,Fthree-campus model across Coleraine and
OL,15,FBushmills work for pupils while
OL,16,Fbuilding a sense of one school
OL,17,Fcommunity.
OL,19,FIt brings together three former
OL,20,Fschools: Coleraine College, North Coast
OL,21,FIntegrated College and Dunluce School.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
