OL,3,GNEWSAHow three schools are becoming one
OL,4,A- but still across three sites
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was previously proposed the school
OL,7,Fcould be housed on a single new-build
OL,8,Fsite, but after a new purpose-built
OL,9,Fschool was reported to cost in the
OL,10,Fregion of #20m, it instead proceeded
OL,11,Fwith a three-campus model and welcomed
OL,12,Fpupils this month.
